# Optional: a real model next to the scripted agent. Copy this file to .env.local, set the key and
# LIVE_MODE=1, and restart: the key alone turns nothing on. The scripted agent needs no key.
# With LIVE_MODE=1, anyone who can reach the app can run the model on this key: there is no rate limit.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
LIVE_MODE=
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.4-mini
